@model Fanex.Affiliate.User.Core.ViewModels.RevenueSharingStructureViewModel

<div class="content-group">
    <div class="title-container">
        <div class="index-number">01</div>
        <div class="title-block">
            <div class="title"><span>@Lang.WhatWeHave</span></div>
            <div class="button-toggle"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block">
        <p> Top-notch gaming and online betting products such as Sports, Live Casino, Virtual Sports, Keno, Slot games, plus a wide selection of games</p>
        <p>Renowned brand with over 5 languages so it is easier for you to attract members</p>
        <p>Strategic Marketing tools ensuring high member conversion and retention rate</p>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="content-group">
    <div class="title-container">
        <div class="index-number">02</div>
        <div class="title-block">
            <div class="title"><span>@Lang.WhatWeOffer</span></div>
            <div class="button-toggle"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block">
        <p> Up to @Model.MaxCommission revenue share rate</p>
        <p> An addition of 10% – recruit friends to join our Affiliate program as your sub-affiliate and get your reward!</p>
        <p> Effective and easy-to-use management system for your performance tracking</p>
        <p>Friendly and professional affiliate team always ready to assist you</p>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="content-group">
    <div class="title-container">
        <div class="index-number">03</div>
        <div class="title-block">
            <div class="title"><span>@Lang.OurPlan</span></div>
            <div class="button-toggle"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block">
        <p>Your revenue share consists of two parts: (i) from your referred player’s betting losses and (ii) from your referred affiliate’s revenue share:</p>
        <p><strong>i. Regular Commission Struct:</strong></p>
        @{ Html.RenderPartial($"~/Views/CommissionStructure/{Model.SiteName}/_RevenueShareTable.cshtml"); }
        <p><strong>Company’s Net Profit:</strong> The actual profit remaining from the monthly net loss of all players recommended by you to @Model.SiteFriendlyName after deducting all related costs.</p>
        <p><strong>Qualified Player:</strong> Members with at least USD 100.00 in wagering turnover per calendar month.</p>
        <p>Negative revenue share for any given month will be carried forward to the following month.</p>
        <p>All affiliates are subject to administrative and marketing costs incurred directly for the acquisition of members.</p>
        <p>
            The cost deducted from the revenue on a monthly basis. This cost may include the following:
            <ul class="dash">
                <li>
                    <strong>Banking Fee</strong> - Deposit and Withdrawal charges for each involving all the affiliate's customers.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Royalty Fee</strong> - Product royalty fees incurred involving all affiliate customers.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Promotion bonuses</strong> - Monetary bonuses or rebates given to the affiliate customers.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </p>
        <p class="text">Example:</p>
        <p class="text"><i><strong>Positive Revenue</strong></i></p>
        <div>
            <p class="text">Gross Revenue = USD 60,000</p>
            <p class="text">Bonus Expenses = USD 5,000</p>
            <p class="text">Transaction Fees = USD 550</p>
            <p class="text">Royalty Fees = USD 2,500</p>
            <p class="text">Commission = </p>
            <p class="text">(Gross Revenue - Bonus Expenses - Transaction Fees - Royalty Fees) x Revenue Share %</p>
            <p class="text">(60,000 − 5,000 − 550 − 2,500) × 45% = USD 23,377.5</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text"><i><strong>Negative Revenue</strong></i></p>
        <div>
            <p class="text">Gross revenue = -USD 5,000</p>
            <p class="text">Member’s bonus = USD 500</p>
            <p class="text">Transaction Fees = USD 150</p>
            <p class="text">Commission = </p>
            <p class="text">(Gross Revenue - Bonus Expenses - Transaction Fees) x Revenue Share %</p>
            <p class="text">(-5,000 - 500 - 150) × 25% = USD -1,412.50 (Carry forward to following month)</p>
        </div>
        <p>
            <strong>ii. Sub-Affiliate Structure:</strong> you will be eligible to receive an extra 10% from your referred affiliates’ revenue share,
            and as long as they bring other affiliates in, you can also have a share from their sub-affiliates’ revenue share either!
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="content-group">
    <div class="title-container">
        <div class="index-number">04</div>
        <div class="title-block">
            <div class="title"><span>@Lang.RevenueSharePayoutExample</span></div>
            <div class="button-toggle"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block">
        <p><strong>Figure 1:</strong> An example to show you how your revenue share earned from your referred players is calculated</p>
        @{ Html.RenderPartial($"~/Views/CommissionStructure/{Model.SiteName}/_ExampleTable.cshtml"); }
        <p><strong>Figure 2:</strong> An example to show you how your revenue share earned from your referred affiliates (and their sub-affiliates) is calculated</p>
        <div class="img-support" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 15px auto;">
            <img class="img-responsive" src="~/www/build/styles/Images/revenue-share-structure/@(Model.SiteName)/revenue-share-desktop.@(Model.CurrentLanguage).png" alt="hierarchy banner" />
        </div>
        <p>Your revenue share earned from the referred affiliates:</p>
        <div>
            <p class="text">
                = [B1+ ((C1 + C2) * 10%)]*10% + [B2 * 10%]
            </p>
            <p class="text">
                = [0 + (50,000 + 30,000) * 10%)]*10% + [70,000 * 10%]
            </p>
            <p class="text">
                = USD 7,800
            </p>
        </div>
        <p>
            <strong>=></strong> Your total revenue share for the month would be: 69,500 + 7,800 = <strong>USD 77,300</strong>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="content-group">
    <div class="title-container">
        <div class="index-number">05</div>
        <div class="title-block">
            <div class="title"><span>@Lang.HowWePay</span></div>
            <div class="button-toggle"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="content-block">
        <p> Once a month, through your @Model.SiteFriendlyName player account (in USD, THB, MYR, IDR, INR, CNY, BDT &amp; VND) and the minimum withdrawal amount is USD 100. For other currencies need to request from @Model.SiteFriendlyName Affiliate team.</p>
        <p>Any 2nd withdrawal request in the same month shall be subject to @Model.SiteFriendlyName Affiliates team’s approval.</p>
    </div>
</div>